  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to Support Guinea-Bissau Fish Exports to the European Market</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of this assignment is to support Guinea-Bissau authorities and economic operators on exporting fish to the EU markets. The tasks will include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) Diagnosis / state of play / recommendations (especially in the mentioned areas of legislation, competent authority, control system, supervision).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Details of the assignment are specified&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1-Tender Dossier Terms of Reference ARES 5415090-09Jun23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2-Tender Proposal ARES 7159462 05Jul23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3-Negotiated Report ARES 4785260 10Jul23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2) Roadmap proposal;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3)Action Plan&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Addedndum:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;Update the roadmap and action plan and specifically the timeline for the respective implementation, followed with presentation and discussion in GB with the involved authorities and stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;Develop a food safety assurance manual-model for the industry sector to follow in accordance with the EU fish export requirements, with presentation and discussion in GB with the relevant operators and authorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;Assist and support in the development of food safety assurance systems for each selected operator who meet the minimal satisfactory infrastructure conditions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
